I saw on other posts that you want to save the bones files. Well, here's
what the complete autoexec.bat would look like:

@echo off
unzip nethack.zip e:
e:/nethack.exe
zip e:\* a:/nethack.zip

That way, as soon as you quit nethack, it zips up the ramdive, bones files
and all, back on to the floppy disk.



